id: splitting
name: Splitting
kind: signature
side: advantages
tpCost: 4
tpCostPerRank: 4, 6
ranks: 2
requirement: Energy or Magic Foundation that does not have an Area of Effect.
requires: foundation:energy|foundation:magic, !aoe
summary: Up to 2 (rank 1) or 4 (rank 2) targets; Wound -1(T) per target after the first.
description: >
  Your attack splits into several projectiles that let it strike more than one enemy.
text: >
  Splitting: Your attack splits into several projectiles that let it strike more than one enemy.
  –TP Cost: 4 (First Rank), 6 (Second Rank)
  –Requirement: Energy or Magic Foundation that does not have an Area of Effect.
  –Effect: At Attack Declaration, when using this Signature Technique, select up to 2 Opponents (First Rank) or up to 4 Opponents (Second Rank). They are the targets for this Attacking Maneuver. For each Opponent you chose after the first, reduce your Wound Roll by 1(T).

